<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp. said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Florida, $13.26 million revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Clyde-Savannah Central School District, N.Y., $12.795 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Orangeburg School District No 2, S.C., $10 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
